## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design SLA-aware routing with multi-tenant fairness, regulatory constraints, and cost.

## Key Concepts
- SLA/QoS, model pools, edge vs cloud, real-time routing, circuit breakers, fault isolation, observability.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for routing decision
function route(request, tenancy, pools, metrics) {
  const budget = tenancy.latencyBudget;
  const eta = estimateETA(request, pools, metrics);
  const chosen = (eta <= budget) ? selectPool(pools, tenancy) : escalateFallback(tenancy);
  return chosen;
}
```

